## Reviewer Outcomes Overview

Reviewer outcomes are separate from submitter verdicts:

| Outcome | When |
|---------|------|
| **Accept** | Submission is accurate, complete, and well-supported; corrected task meets requirements. |
| **Needs Revision** | Task still has authoring errors the submitter can fix. Prefer this while revision cycles remain. |
| **Reject** | Use **only** after maximum revision cycles are exhausted and more work is still needed. |

Also assign a **Submission Quality Score** (1–5) reflecting accuracy, completeness, reasoning, and specificity of the submission.

Reviewers must read **Comments for Reviewer** / rebuttal before finishing and acknowledge whether those notes changed the decision.

